Codemap topology viewer

This product includes the code-modernization topology viewer from Anthropic's
claude-plugins-official repository, commit
ad30d62cd52ad0d0af1beda1eab7f61c601045d0, distributed under Apache License 2.0.
See LICENSE.apache-2.0 and VENDORED.md.

The viewer includes an inlined D3 v7 subset, distributed under ISC:
Copyright 2010-2023 Mike Bostock
The full copyright, permission notice and disclaimer are in LICENSE.d3-ISC
and embedded in the viewer so generated standalone HTML retains them.

Codemap modifications preserve and display snapshot identity, exact-edge
provenance, safe source-span links, unresolved call-site annotations, and
admitted, qualified observed-graph absence witnesses, plus responsive viewport
fitting and mobile details. Original upstream
layout, drawing, navigation and inline D3 code are retained.
